# Experiment train registry (docs/testflight-release.md).
# One line per experiment: <name>=<train number ≥ 101>. The number becomes
# the version's patch component (nearest tag 2.0 + gnss-exp=101 → 2.0.101),
# giving each experiment its own TestFlight release train. Auto-assigned and
# auto-committed by `ios/scripts/release.sh --exp <name>` on first use — edit
# by hand only to retire a name. Numbers are never reused.
